{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/ec54656b4ef34b32b8c69510cb2b7850"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/ae9dfafb5fe14d349e3a329e1757d177"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/801ad37229c640f7bdaeb24c5a7a7e0b"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/ec54656b4ef34b32b8c69510cb2b7850","stringItemText":"Geotechnical Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/ae9dfafb5fe14d349e3a329e1757d177","stringItemText":"Concrete Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/801ad37229c640f7bdaeb24c5a7a7e0b","stringItemText":"Soil Testing"}],"settingsData":[]}
